eness (task 3) — clean for the public surface; minor internal shrinkage, unused.**\n- `src/store.ts` no longer re-exports `ensureMergeConfig` (main did, via `transport.js`). It's still exported from `src/transport.ts`. Nothing in `src/` imports it from `store.js`, and `index.ts` never exposed it on main either. Severity: cosmetic.\n- `src/git.ts` drops `statusPorcelain`, `revList`, `GitRunOptions` (unused anywhere in current `src/`, not part of main's `index.ts` surface, still present in `annals/src/git.ts`). Severity: cosmetic.\n- `src/review.ts` drops `Screen`, `ViewState`, `renderView` (unused in `src/`, not on main's public surface). Severity: cosmetic.\n- `src/forge/github.ts` deleted entirely (`isGitHubOrigin`, `githubDriver`); logic now lives in `annals/src/forge/`, `forgeForRepo` still delegates correctly. Severity: clean.\n- `canonical.ts`, `reanchor.ts`, `reanchor-suggest.ts`, `schema.ts`, `redact/apply.ts`, `redact/scan.ts`, `redact/known-secrets.ts`, `redact/config.ts` — export sets verified line-by-line against `main`; all match (modulo the intentional `CledgerConfig = AnnalsConfig` alias). Severity: clean.\n- All ~19 deleted test files have equivalents under `annals/src/test/`, confirming tests were relocated, not dropped.\n\n**`cli.ts` semantics (task 4) — clean.** `--kind` stays a plain string from the CLI arg parser (`Flags` is `{[key]: string|boolean}`, never an array), so the `ReadOptions.kind: string|string[]` widening in `annals` doesn't change CLI behavior; the `typeof opts.kind === \"string\"` guard in `displayFilter` is equivalent to the old `opts.kind !== undefined` check for every real CLI call. `readOptionsFrom`'s `--conversation` flag correctly now sets `opts.stream`. `loadConfig(repo)` (was `loadConfig(repo.root)`) matches the new `redact/config.ts` wrapper signature at both call sites (`cmdScan`, `cmdReAnchor`). Command dispatch (`append/log/show/conversations/export/sync/transport-push/scan/review/inspect/allow/redact/re-anchor/renorma